  "summary": "I run Portfolio Ventures – a leading UK Seed Fund and angel network investing in fintech, SaaS & vertical AI at seed. \n\nSince 2015, we've backed over 100+ companies as angels, including unicorns Tractable, Marshmallow & ManyPets. Since 2021 we've been deploying from our Angel Fund and invested in pre-seed & seed rounds of Swap ($40m Series B), Tilt ($18m Series A), ECS (Series A), Passionfruit ($9m Series A), Bulbshare (Acquired), Supercede ($15m Series A), Infact (£4m seed), Zelt ($5m seed) etc. \n\nOur LPs are 200+ of Europe’s leading angels, including exited founders and C-level execs from FTSE100/250 companies, of which 75% invest alongside the Angel Fund.\n\nOur £200k-£500k investments come with a huge network of LPs, angels, and founders with decades of combined experience.\n\nWill Brooks and I started PV because we recognise the importance of community and network as founders scale. I've angel-invested in over 100 companies and we launched the Angel Fund to be the \"co-investor of choice\", always bringing smart capital and an unrivalled network. \n\nFor investors, we build diverse portfolios of early-stage companies providing access to deals you would not get otherwise. We invest in amazing founders, always following top-tier VCs but with all the benefits of EIS.\n\nTech founder raising pre-seed to late seed? Angel investor interested in sharing dealflow? \n\nPlease get in touch!",
