      "description": "I co-founded Portfolio Ventures in 2014 with Will Brooks. We are one of the UK's leading angel funds\nbacked by exited founders, angels, C-level execs and corporate NEDs.\n\nWe back exceptional founders building cutting-edge fintech and SaaS companies with £250k co-investing cheques alongside lead institutional investors. The companies we've invested in are listed in my experience below.\n\nBefore launching the Angel Fund in 2021, we ran a highly successful investor network, raising £70m for 230 companies. We have been privileged to have worked with and angel invested in some great companies including Smart Pension, Credit Kudos, Pensionbee, Penfold, Apexx, Funding Xchange, Wealth Kernel, Griffin, Xelix, Origin, Attest, Ably, Shipamax, Rotageek, Continuum, Many Pets, Marshmallow, Flock, Cazana, Bikmo, Equipsme, Urban Jungle, OLIO, Mindful Chef, Lexoo, Different Dog, Much Better Adventures, Thriva, Elvie, my recovery, uMed, Span, Tractable, Foundries.io, and Genus AI to name a few.\n\nI live in London with Vicky and our 3 boys. I love baking bread, riding my bike and working my way through the greatest books of all time. Any recommendations are most welcome!",
